          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most homes, DAP Plastic Wood-X is the right everyday filler: easy to apply, clear about when it is ready to sand, and good inside and out under paint. Choose Minwax Stainable or Goodfilla when the repair will be stained, Minwax High Performance or KwikWood for fast, strong exterior fixes, and Abatron WoodEpox when rot has taken real wood away.
          </p>
